# Unreal's build and editor output.
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
.vs/
.idea/
*.sln
*.slnx
# Also written by generating the project files: what Visual Studio needs, and the engine's
# folder for the exporter's csproj.
.vsconfig
*.csproj.props
*.code-workspace
Plugins/*/Binaries/
Plugins/*/Intermediate/
# What .NET builds of the plugins' Unreal Build Tool plugins (Ferreal's exporter).
Plugins/*/Source/*/obj/
# The assets Content/Python/setup_demo.py and the plugin's scripts make: the demo ships none.
*.uasset
*.umap
# What Unreal's Python leaves next to the scripts.
__pycache__/
# The engine's default input settings, which the editor writes out: the demo changes none.
Config/DefaultInput.ini
